          "id": 2220831668,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I.e., you want the output on UN\\*Xes to be something such as\n\n```\n With:\n  +brotli 1.0.9            +libpcap 1.11.0-PRE-GIT  +nghttp3 1.1.0\n\n    ...\n\n```\n\nwithout \"version\" (although probably without Wireshark being linked with a libpcap built from a Git repository :-)).",
